<title>VIETNAM: Indonesia '97 cocoa output seen growing 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Indonesia '97 cocoa output seen growing 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HO CHI MINH CITY, Vietnam 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's cocoa production in 1997 is seen expanding by 10 percent to around 319,000 to 330,000 tonnes, the chairman of the Indonesia Cocoa Association said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
